  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>Bait resources in most of the province are assigned to harvesters through the use of a block system — 1 harvester per ‘bait harvest’ area.</p><p>There are exceptions to the block system (e.g., Lake Erie), where bait is allocated to multiple users fishing the same area.<br /></p><p>This class has related tables. <a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets?q=RT_BAITHARV' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bait Harvest Area related tables</a><br /></p><p></p><p><strong>Additional Documentation</strong><br /></p><p></p><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/BaitHarvestAreaUserGuide_v.01_2015-12-07.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bait Harvest Area User Guide (PDF)</a><br /></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Bait%20Harvest%20Area%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bait Harvest Area - Data Description (PDF)</a><br /></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Bait%20Harvest%20Area%20-%20Documentation.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bait Harvest Area - Documentation (Word)</a></li></ul><p><strong>Status</strong><br /></p><p>On going: Data is continually being updated<br /></p><p></p><p><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></p><p>As needed: Data is updated as deemed necessary<br /></p><p></p><p><strong>Contact</strong><br /></p><p>Mae Rannells-Warren, Fisheries Section, Fish and Wildlife Policy Branch, <a href='mailto:mae.rannells-warren@ontario.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'>mae.rannells-warren@ontario.ca</a></p><p></p>"
